<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian and Eritrean forces are massing troops along their shared border and have carried out overnight drone and artillery strikes near Badme, wounding civilians. In southern Ethiopia, clashes between Ethiopian militia and Somali Federalist Party supporters in Moyale have displaced about 700,000 people, prompting the EU to allocate €550,000 emergency aid. A study reports severe disruption to regional healthcare systems and high rates of suicidal behavior among conflict-affected high schoolers. The conflict has caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNeEJBNVB0dkdmX1h1VU1fRTJkVGdQN3oyWWZlOTBqaFVPOHBIcWk2YlJ1M2poeFpLcWxlNV9rOHBQYTRwdzRaN2ZKbkNveGgyMkFBRmY1b2t4REJSampnVjdaZnlmYVA3Vm1oU0o5T093T0t0QjNQZU8xeHRzWGZRaERvVXJpUFNqZDhQcjZfSVFHSktmVGZ5anIzZWpxMXlfU0VqR2VybTFlSzl1R0M1R01IY1BEanRJSFJQQU5pLWFXMGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPM2NJWm1PUWZVTDJoYU5qOUpvX0h4RXFZZXFPc1JKczU4NThmQVRnRk9XelNOTG9DcWYwaDVJaGVZQVJNa1BNUGtzZThkc1ZQOTlzaHplNXAzaENmejJpWmROMFZnS0s2RXNobFZQc3Yyc3RDV2tRXzRZcjJkandmQWxoS2tsQUlvQmFZU282UVJDbXRuODljQUZZUkpfMm9ScHYwOWZMSDMwUEZUMnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bioengineer.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQdTNxMklzOGk2NXpTcW9wTVROTmFmVkhFaDBmZUlwYXlHN3ptWEhJdC1SWVFtamwway14ZkFqUkJlUkQ3RFNhUFc0QjJHUnF4SHZZLXdVTEsxM0dScTkycnNIOE1sa2hCTU54Rjg2YTBOY1FRb3dSYzhOT0U5bUpONHg4WVZfNDY3S2tRbGgwT1dSODBhN3FINF80WlR1STVjOGdKRTJB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https